29,238,204,229,238,258,282,263,229,221,192,197,197,206,206,216,206,167,167,172,162,135,130,155,145,140,165,155,140,125],"c":[262,262,239,224,248,234,239,234,248,229,238,268,292,292,282,238,241,211,202,216,211,231,226,211,187,182,172,167,150,190,180,170,170,180,155,155,130],"v":[72636300,104750800,76759300,47397800,33929200,134897000,43705600,28657900,69707800,22227100,4829000,31931000,68255000,38295200,29079100,45780100,72852400,48732700,12830900,4546800,8137900,12806400,3831400,9645300,10944700,4402400,2847000,2216200,1663900,2158900,246800,10411500,16742000,22460500,1830100,1173100,4594400]}},"profile":{"website":"https://minox.biz","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","employees":78,"city":"Puchong","summary":"Minox International Group Berhad, an investment holding company, engages in the design, development, import, and distribution of stainless steel sanitary valves, tube and fittings, installation components and equipment, and rubber hoses. The company offers 3-A sanitary fittings and connections; high vacuum and sanitary valves; PFA tubing; control head and positioner; sanitary and ASME BPE tubes and fittings; sanitary unions; installation equipment and components; tank and filtration equipment; aseptic valves, single use consumables, sanitary pump; gauges and instrumentation; FDA rubber hoses; and high purity and vacuum solutions. It also provides management services. The company sells its products under the MINOX brand name, as well as distributes third-party brands, such as Rubber Fab, TEMPRESS, KingLai, and GECITech. It serves the food, beverage, pharmaceutical, and semiconductor industries in Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand, Indonesia, and internationally. Minox International Group Berhad was founded in 1998 and is headquartered in Puchong, Malaysia.","zh":"Minox International Group Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，成立于1998年，总部位于马来西亚蒲种。公司主要从事不锈钢卫生阀门、管道及配件的设计、开发、进口和分销，服务于食品、饮料、制药和半导体行业，业务覆盖马来西亚、新加坡、泰国、印度尼西亚及国际市场。","lines":["卫生阀门与管件：设计、开发和分销不锈钢卫生阀门、管道、配件及安装组件，客户来自食品、饮料、制药和半导体行业。","高纯度与真空解决方案：提供高真空阀门、PFA 管、高纯度管道及真空解决方案，服务于需要高洁净度的行业。","橡胶软管与耗材：供应 FDA 认证橡胶软管、一次性使用耗材、卫生泵等，客户包括食品、饮料和制药企业。","仪表与控制设备：提供控制头、定位器、仪表和仪器，用于卫生流程的控制和监测。","品牌分销与管理服务：以 MINOX 品牌销售产品，并分销 Rubber Fab、TEMPRESS、KingLai 和 GECITech 等第三方品牌，同时提供管理服务。"],"lines_en":["Sanitary Valves & Fittings: Design, develop, and distribute stainless steel sanitary valves, tubes, fittings, and installation components for food, beverage, pharmaceutical, and semiconductor industries.","High Purity & Vacuum Solutions: Offer high vacuum valves, PFA tubing, high purity tubing, and vacuum solutions for high-cleanliness applications.","Rubber Hoses & Consumables: Supply FDA rubber hoses, single-use consumables, and sanitary pumps to food, beverage, and pharmaceutical customers.","Instrumentation & Control: Provide control heads, positioners, gauges, and instrumentation for sanitary process control and monitoring."]}}